%%{init: {"theme": "redux-color"}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer as Customer
    actor OperationsAdmin as Workshop Operations Administrator
    participant UI as Service Ride Interface
    participant Service as Application Service
    participant Records as Service Ride Records
    Customer->>UI: Approve or reject the estimate
    UI->>Service: Submit estimated cost approval request
    Service->>Records: Recheck estimate version and current workshop stock
    Records-->>Service: Return current records and validation result
    alt Request satisfies the business rules
        Service->>Records: Record the decision and reserve approved units as pending
        Records-->>Service: Confirm the saved or calculated result
        Service-->>UI: Allow work after payment is recorded
        UI-->>Customer: Display the result and next step
    else Request needs correction or review
        Service-->>UI: Keep work blocked when approval or payment is missing
        UI-->>Customer: Display the reason and required action
    end
    opt Workshop Operations Administrator participates in this use case
        OperationsAdmin->>UI: Record external approval evidence when needed
        UI->>Service: Submit the role-specific response
        Service->>Records: Save the additional case action
        Records-->>Service: Confirm the additional action
        Service-->>OperationsAdmin: Return the recorded outcome
    end
